with Datastore,

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:16.440
and that all Datastore
databases will be converted

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.090
to Firestore under the covers.

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.497
Is that right?

00:02:19.497 --> 00:02:20.580
WESLEY CHUN: Yeah, Martin.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.410
Once converted, they
will be operating

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:26.160
in Datastore Compatibility Mode,
or Firestore in Datastore mode,

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.220
