00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:48.390
dump the Datastore data
out of my current project,

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:52.260
and load it into Firestore
in the new project?

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.670
WESLEY CHUN: Yep, you got it.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.890
And now you know why
this is even more

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:59.040
optional than moving from
Cloud NDB to Cloud Datastore.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.630
At least with that
migration, you

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.370
don't have to create
a brand new project.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:04.290
But this one does require that.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:07.320
And it doesn't matter if it's
App Engine app, Cloud Run,

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.720
or even a non-Cloud
